WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.031
KINGO
We are the Eternals.

00:00:02.862 --> 00:00:04.312
KINGO
The Avengers have Thor,

00:00:04.872 --> 00:00:05.872
Spiderman,

00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:07.521
but we have Thena.

00:00:07.572 --> 00:00:08.572
THENA
Hello.

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:11.083
PHASTOS
I'm sure that was a lot of fun for you.

00:00:11.134 --> 00:00:12.134
THENA
It was.

00:00:14.442 --> 00:00:15.442
IKARIS
Eternals assemble.

00:00:15.493 --> 00:00:16.493
KINGO
Great line.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.046
JACK
Dad, I saw him on TV

00:00:22.097 --> 00:00:23.765
with a cape
shooting laser beams.

00:00:24.547 --> 00:00:25.547
IKARIS
I don't wear a cape.

00:00:25.598 --> 00:00:26.598
THENA
Ha Ha.

